<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Federal Flour 6-mth net falls.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Federal Flour 6-mth net falls.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		  (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  29.71   vs	  86.35</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)     13.31   vs	  37.17</p>
<p>    Turnover		 1,717.81   vs     1,900.18</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    39.86   vs	  81.61</p>
<p>    Minorities	    less 1.58   vs    less 0.35</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	  -     vs	     -</p>
<p>NOTE - Federal Flour Mills Bhd is a flour miller and trader of consumer products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
